<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.3">
<l>vayiṟṟil toḻuvaip pirittu vaṉpulac cēvai yatakki</l>
<l>kayiṟṟu makkāṇi kaḻittuk kāliṭaip pācaṅ kaḻaṟṟi</l>
<l>yeyiṟṟiṭai maṇkoṇṭa ventai yirāppaka lōtuvit teṉṉaip</l>
<l>payiṟṟip paṇiceyyak koṇṭāṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Severing the womb in [my] belly,</l>
<l rend="indent">constraining the bull [of my] powerful senses,</l>
<l>and removing the sinew and bone [from my] body,</l>
<l rend="indent">undoing the fetters from [my] feet,</l>
<l>my father, who took the earth upon [his] tusks,</l>
<l rend="indent">training me, teaching [me] the vedas night and day,</l>
<l>takes me to do [his] service.</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
